message: "If you use this blueprint, please cite it as below."
title: "MiCoKnowGraph: a collaborative knowledge-graph blueprint for microbiome research"
abstract: >-
  LinkML schema, SSSOM mappings, competency questions and tooling for a unified,
  interoperable microbiome knowledge graph. Draft prepared as a starting point for
  BioHackathon Europe 2026, Project 16 (ELIXIR Microbiome Community).
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
keywords:
  - microbiome
  - knowledge graph
  - LinkML
  - ontology
  - SSSOM
  - FAIR
authors:
